{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-59-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/B-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-41-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>張生張太說自重建公布後，已陸續清貨，見進度差不多，數個月前決定 7 月 31 日結業。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/C-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-27-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/D-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-14-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/E-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-49-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/F-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-42-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>店面接近 700 呎，有多個高至天花的書櫃，張太說，現已很難有這麼大的空間讓漫畫店藏書，「唔淨係至 hit 嘅漫畫，其他嗰啲唔 hit 但好睇嘅我哋都有」。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/G-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-04-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/H-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-30-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/I-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-50-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/J-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-54-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>張生幫客人封箱，並推車上客貨車，並道：「驚D後生推唔慣車仔啊。」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/K-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-23-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/L-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-12-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/M-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-26-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/N-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-25-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/O-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-63-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/P-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-43-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Q-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-58-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-34-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/R-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-09-683x1024.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/S-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-61-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/T-20260731ChoiHungComicsStore-66-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<p>詳細文字報道： 彩虹邨重建｜漫畫世界　最後分店結業　笑對起跌　清貨答謝　「任何嘢都會有終結一日」</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-01T08:38:54.134225+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":22,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}